 HỘI QUÁN PLEX</p>', 'Full', 1, 'single', 'completed', 6, 2023, 'Vietsub', 'FHD', 'Hàn Quốc', 0, '[{"name":"Choi Ji-woo","avatar":""},{"name":"Jeong Dong-won","avatar":""},{"name":"Lee You-mi","avatar":""},{"name":"Minho","avatar":""},{"name":"Pyo Ji-hoon","avatar":""},{"name":"Ha Da-in","avatar":""},{"name":"Lee Moon-sik","avatar":""},{"name":"Lee Joo-sil","avatar":""},{"name":"Hwang Seung-eon","avatar":""},{"name":"Lee Dong-kyu","avatar":""},{"name":"Hah Kyoung","avatar":""},{"name":"Yerin","avatar":""},{"name":"Kim Mi-hwa","avatar":""},{"name":"Lee Ju-woo","avatar":""}]', '[{"name":"Kinh Dị","slug":"kinh-di","id":"4db8d7d4b9873981e3eeb76d02997d58"},{"name":"Tâm Lý","slug":"tam-ly","id":"a7b065b92ad356387ef2e075dee66529"},{"name":"Bí Ẩn","slug":"bi-an","id":"2fb53017b3be83cd754a08adab3e916c"}]', '["新常态","恐怖日常怪談","New Normal","뉴 노멀"]', 1784690324250);
