gui shi lu","Strange Tales of Tang Dynasty III To Changan","Strange Tales of Tang Dynasty 2","Strange Tales of Tang Dynasty 3","Strange Tales of Tang Dynasty 3: To Changan","Strange Tales of Tang Dynasty II To the West","Strange Chronicles of Tang","Strange Tales of Tang Dynasty V: The Forbidden Shu Road","Strange Legend of Tang Dynasty Ⅲ","Đường Triều Quỷ Sự Lục 3: Trường An"]', 1784690324262);
